flowchart LR
    Client["Client App"] -->|POST /sessions\n{userId, scenarioId}| SessGW["Session Gateway"]
    SessGW --> SessCtrl["Session Controller"]
    SessCtrl -->|create.session\n{userId, scenarioId}| Orch["Orchestrator Svc"]
    Orch -->|session.row| SessRepo["Session Repo"] --> PG["Postgres"]
    Orch -->|cache session JSON| Redis[(Redis)]
    SessCtrl -->|201 {sessionId}| SessGW --> Client

    Client -->|POST /sessions/:id/turns\n{inputType, meta}| SessGW --> SessCtrl
    SessCtrl -->|create.turn\n{sessionId}| Orch
    Orch -->|turn.row| TurnRepo["Turn Repo"] --> PG
    SessCtrl -->|201 {turnId}| SessGW --> Client
    Orch -.->|publish simulation.started\n{sessionId, turnId}| MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
